title: Delegation to Moscow
subtitle: The <span class="p-comintern">Comintern</span> Executive hears the German party in person.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_moscow
view-if: rf_delegation_timer <= 0 and funds >= 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_delegation_timer = 3

= Delegation to Moscow

You can send a delegation to the Executive Committee of the International (ECCI). It settles German questions there, often before the German party has discussed them.

- @argue
- @listen

@argue
title: Argue the German party's own view.
subtitle: Keeps some independence. Pleases the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Angers <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
window.RF.defy(Q, 4);
!}

Your delegates argue well. Some of the Russian leaders are impressed; others take note of German independence.

@listen
title: Listen, and promise to carry out the ECCI's decisions.
subtitle: Pleases Moscow and <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>. Angers the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Costs party autonomy.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
window.RF.obey(Q, 10);
!}

Your delegates promise discipline. Moscow likes obedient Germans. The precedent will outlive you.
